WEBVTT

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.220
Adding grace to the event,

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.640
the third Meijin Kawaguchi!

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:23.220
And the female Meijin,
Lady Kawaguchi!

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.480
You've just seen their
exhibition Gunpla Battle.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.440
Everyone, let's give them
a big round of applause!

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:35.070
And now, the Gunpla
builder's contest,

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.900
the Meijin Cup, begins!

00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:02.090
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:07.600
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.350
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.110
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:18.650
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:23.200
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.830
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:31.420
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.130
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:36.840
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:42.130
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:48.680
<i>Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away</i>

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:10.040
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.000
Episode 25
Our Gunpla

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.480
This one doesn't even
fit in the case.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:36.980
Disqualified

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.110
Disqualified
Whoever built it must be an idiot.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.440
Yeah, an idiot.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.440
Totally.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.910
A buncha gals must be
gossiping about me again.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:50.290
Open Course

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.960
So this is Mamoru's work?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.330
It's well built.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.750
How exciting!

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:01.630
I put everything I had
into building this.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:06.640
But I'm gonna build an even better one
for next year's championship, right, Brother?

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.300
Yeah. I look forward to it, Mamoru.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.510
Yeah!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.390
By the way, isn't Gyanko with you?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.690
Miss Kaoruko is...

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.060
Uh, she's stopping by later, I guess.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.610
Open Course

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.500
What a great piece of work!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.580
The style is completely different
from the standard product.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:39.250
It almost looks like
a full scratch-build.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.170
Well done, Yuuma Kousaka.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.090
Your victory in the
Artistic Gunpla Contest...

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.680
...wasn't just for show.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.850
President, your friend's entry
is really something.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.100
Really? Let me see...

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.940
This one's by Minato Sakai
of the Shingyo School.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.360
Th-This is...!

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:07.910
Mr. Ral!

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.950
Did I keep you waiting?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.700
No. I only just got here, too.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.700
Then let's go inside.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:15.790
Yes.
Yes.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.630
Yuu, have you
heard from Sekai?

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.710
No I haven't, but...

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.840
He skipped the awards ceremony
and disappeared all of a sudden.

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.800
I'm on a training trip
- Sekai

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.890
He takes action the moment
something occurs to him.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:37.180
Yes, that boy is like the wind.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.980
Maybe more like a storm.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.820
Look at all the people!

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:47.030
If you want to see the exhibits,
please go ahead.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.530
Aren't you coming, Yuu?

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.780
Minato Sakai said to me...

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:56.410
<i>Yuuma, Let's not see each other's
work until the awards ceremony.</i>

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.370
<i>Why?</i>

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.750
<i>The winner is going to be
either your entry or mine.</i>

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:03.540
<i>So let's keep things dramatic.</i>

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.090
<i>Got it? Be sure not to look at it!</i>

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:09.470
That sounds just like Sakai.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:10.720
Excuse me...

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:14.760
Are you Miss Fumina Hoshino
from team Try Fighters?

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.100
Y-Yes. ..

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.430
I saw you in the championship!

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:20.640
I want to build
my own unique Gunpla,

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:23.520
and become a fighter like you.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:24.820
Thanks.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:25.730
Good luck!

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:26.570
Yeah!

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.700
She's just like we used to be.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:33.990
Yes.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.910
It's been a while, Try Fighters.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.500
From the Miyazato Institute...

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.620
I saw your model.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.000
It's well built.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.210
Thank you very much.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.010
Wh-What is it?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.430
ls there something on my face?

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.010
No, it's nothing.
No, no.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.020
Hey, it's her.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.890
The one from the...

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.940
I'd be so embarrassed.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:07.610
Wha... What?!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.150
<i>The Meijin Cup awards
ceremony is about to begin.</i>

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.120
So you came, Yuuma Kousaka.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.080
Minato Sakai.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.700
I haven't seen your entry,
just as we promised.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:20.830
Good.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.790
Now, let's see who the winner is.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:24.920
Yeah.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.040
<i>Thank you for waiting!</i>

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:32.630
We now begin the awards ceremony
of the Meijin Cup builder's contest.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.480
First, we'll announce
the junior course.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.360
Let's welcome the presenter,
Ms. Lady Kawaguchi.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:56.700
The champion of the
Meijin Cup's junior course is...

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.740
Say Mamoru's name! Mamoru!

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:01.750
Entry number five.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.580
<i>Tateo Sazaki's model,</i>

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.540
<i>"Gyan.</i> II

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.460
Sazaki?

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:12.590
That Gyan...

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:13.590
Could it be...?

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.930
You did it, Tateo!
You're the champion!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.060
Of course, dear sister Gyanko.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.770
Her little brother?!
Her little brother?!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.940
How many siblings are there
in the Sazaki family?

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:32.030
I heard there's another
little brother who's even cuter.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:34.190
What the heck?
They're like the Zabi family.

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:38.160
Sazaki, may we have a word?

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.580
I was obviously going to win.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.870
But there were some
other pretty good ones.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.790
Mamoru lzuna!

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.830
You... are my rival!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.630
A new friend, huh?

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:53.550
Yeah.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.970
Next, we'll announce
the Open Course.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:01.510
Let's welcome the presenter,
the third Meijin Kawaguchi!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:07.310
The champion of the
Meijin Cup's Open Course is...

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:10.230
Come on! Entry number nine!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.610
Number nine! Please, Meijin!

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:14.400
Entry number...

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:15.650
...nine!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:18.570
Yes! I won!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:20.820
Sorry.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.660
Entry number six!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.750
Yuuma Kousaka,
"Lightning Zeta Gundam."

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.040
<i>Mr. Yuuma Kousaka,</i>

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.210
<i>please come up on the stage!</i>

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:40.970
Congratulations, Kousaka.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.470
Thank you very much.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.930
First the championship,
and then the Meijin Cup.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.140
You've tried very hard.

00:09:48.890 --> 00:09:50.850
Because I was cheered on.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.030
Congratulations, Yuu!

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.740
That's my boy.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.610
Did he win?

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:01.320
Yeah!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.580
Sekai?!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.080
Wh-Where have you been all this time?

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.750
Didn't I leave a note saying
I was on a training trip?

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.960
B-But we were worried!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:17.130
We thought you
might not come back.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:19.800
Of course I came back.

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:24.640
I'm gonna play Gunpla Battle
here with you and Yuuma!

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:26.930
Right.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.850
Ouch... My bottom is...

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.520
Mr. Kousaka, would you like-

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:33.770
Objection!

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.860
Objection, objection...

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.070
Objection!

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:40.240
Why is the champion Yuuma,
instead of me?

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.820
Meijin, have your eyes gone bad?

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.200
We do our best to judge impartially.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.120
Then it should be mine!

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.460
Minato, what kind
of model did you build?

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.960
Okay, I'll show you.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.670
With my sincerest feelings,

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.800
I built this by following my heart.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:01.220
It's my ultimate masterpiece!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.870
Hey, isn't that you, Hoshino?

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:31.120
Wh... Wha... Wha...

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.000
What is that?!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.500
This is my ultimate masterpiece.

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.130
"Super Fumina!"

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.840
When did he...

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.390
Look at this beautiful modeling!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.680
The anime-style paint changes
the shading based on the angle.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:55.150
The separate moving parts
of the joints are almost invisible!

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:59.110
The ultra-fine fibers of the hair
are luxuriant and smooth.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.900
I used soft resin to make
the torso nice and squishy...

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:05.990
And guess what?
The eyes even blink!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.490
Y-You...

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:13.870
Wh-What have you built?!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.330
Isn't it great?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.920
The best part is that the waist is
10 percent thinner than the real Fumina's.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.920
You idiot!!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.090
Meijin.

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:26.970
Tell me, exactly what's wrong
with this wonderful model?

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:30.390
Sakai, Gunpla is freedom.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.930
It has limitless possibilities.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.390
But there are minimum rules
everyone must follow!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.570
It's inexcusable that you
didn't get her permission!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:41.780
But...

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:44.940
So you simply won't
accept our judgement?

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:48.030
Then you and Yuuma
must settle this.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.990
Yes, that's right.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.160
In Gunpla Battle!
In Gunpla Battle!

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.960
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode startup.</i>

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:00.250
<i>Model damage level, set to C.</i>

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.880
Please set your GP Base.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:05.670
Let's do it, Yuuma!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.840
If we must.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.840
No, don't use that machine!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:13.220
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:17.640
<i>Field 1, Space.</i>

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.150
Please set your Gunpla.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.660
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:32.330
Yuuma Kousaka,
Lightning Zeta Gundam!

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.660
Minato Sakai, Super Fumina!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.580
Here I go!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.420
Here goes!

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.090
It's even worse when it moves!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.050
<i>Yuuma, can you attack my Gunpla?</i>

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:56.020
<i>I mean, Super Fumina is so cute.</i>

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:59.310
Don't make it do those weird poses!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.650
And don't peek from below.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:06.440
By the way, when it's hit,
it casts off parts.

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:08.740
You must stop fighting!

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.450
It's okay, Hoshino.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.910
<i>Kan“</i>

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:21.210
<i>I'll pin it down!</i>

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.130
What's that Gunpla?

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:24.880
It's not the Try Burning!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.420
<i>Sekai, what's that Gunpla?</i>

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.550
I built it on my training trip.

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:35.050
My own original Gunpla
that I imagined and built.

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:36.510
<i>Its name is...</i>

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.440
<i>Kamiki Burning Gundam!</i>

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:42.850
He gave it his own name.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.110
He's such a child.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:44.610
Yeah.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.900
But Sekai's still a beginner.
How did he build such a great Gunpla?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.530
He didn't just paint it,
he remodeled it, too!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.160
Isn't it good?

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:54.530
It can't be!

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.870
The person Sekai was training with...

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.590
<i>Hey! Stay still.</i>

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.130
<i>No. Don't!</i>

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:14.590
<i>An attack?!</i>

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:20.060
Sekai! Why did you learn Gunpla
building from Miss Shia Kijima?!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.940
It could've been me,
or even Miss Fumina!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.190
Well, I wanted to surprise you all.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:28.610
<i>I don't like this surprise!
I don't like this surprise!</i>

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:29.440
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.610
Are you okay, Sekai?

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.530
Y-Yes. Thank you.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:35.870
<i>What? !</i>

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.620
<i>How annoying!</i>

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.620
<i>When someone makes Gyanko cry,</i>

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.790
<i>this Gyan won't forgive them!</i>

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.800
<i>Wait!</i>

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.340
That looks fun.

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:53.380
Yeah.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.430
I wanna join in.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:55.300
Me too!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.220
Let's go.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:56.970
Yeah.
Yeah.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.060
Let's go help Miss Kaoruko!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.560
Absolutely!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:01.560
Brother.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:02.350
Yeah!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.600
Let's join in, too!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.140
Me, too!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:06.850
Let's g Q!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:24.830
<i>The awards ceremony ended
while I was constipated.</i>

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:30.380
And how come I'm not the champion?!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:35.510
Bugs?

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:38.680
The Lafressia doesn't
have those in the specs!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.220
Down you go!

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:44.180
<i>Down!</i>

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:47.270
How selfish!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.690
<i>Say what you like.</i>

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.130
No, my masterpiece!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.920
<i>I don't know who you are,
but your conduct is uncool.</i>

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.920
Like I said!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:22.970
<i>I'm from Honmoku Academy,
representing Kanagawa!</i>

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.270
<i>I'm Kei Karima!</i>

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.070
<i>They've totally
forgotten about us.</i>

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.820
Kousaka!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.070
<i>Miss Mirai!</i>

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.530
<i>H-Help me!</i>

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.470
<i>Why are you in the battle?</i>

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:03.140
Well, it looked like fun, so...

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.060
I agree.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.680
This is so much fun.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.940
But over there, it's a massacre.

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.820
<i>H-Hoshino, take it easy!</i>

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.400
<i>Answer me, Sekai.</i>

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.610
What's going on between
you and Miss Shia Kijima?!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.240
W-We're friends!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.820
<i>Sekai, don't be so shy.</i>

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.580
Stop pretending!

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:28.080
I know you're just friends!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.130
<i>Wh-What?!</i>

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.430
<i>Just watching is boring.</i>

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.930
I'm joining in, too.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.850
Meijin Kawaguchi!
Meijin Kawaguchi!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:50.060
Why?

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:51.060
You're so immature!

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:55.150
You could say I'm enjoying
my second childhood.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.860
<i>What?!
What?!</i>

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.400
Can't you take a hint, Meijin?

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.330
<i>Lieutenant Ral's Dom R35!</i>

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:11.540
<i>I'm curious to see how
their relationships will unfold.</i>

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:14.460
Please don't interfere!

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.380
Now that's immature!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.910
<i>I-It's too much!</i>

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.410
<i>Miss Hoshino!</i>

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:50.040
<i>MS. Lady?</i>

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.500
<i>I'll keep my promise.</i>

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:54.420
Bring it on!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.210
Alright!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.920
<i>I want to fight Ms. Lady, too!</i>

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.090
<i>Me too!</i>

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:01.880
<i>No problem.</i>

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:03.590
<i>I'll take you all on together!</i>

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:12.180
<i>Come fight me, Sekai Kamiki.</i>

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:13.640
<i>Akira Suga?</i>

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.730
I've always wanted to
fight you one-on-one.

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:17.360
Yeah, same here.

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.520
Let's go!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.630
Gunpla Battle is so much fun!

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.380
It's such a shame.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:48.430
If only I had encountered
Gunpla sooner, then I...

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.850
<i>I envy you.</i>

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.680
<i>Because you're still a beginner,</i>

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:57.560
you can enjoy new discoveries
and surprises in everything.

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:02.780
<i>That emotion is an important thing
that you can only feel now.</i>

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:04.650
Yuuma.

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:06.150
<i>Sekai.</i>

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.660
<i>Our goal is still far away.</i>

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.160
Let's head for it together!

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.330
<i>All three of us!</i>

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.250
Hoshino...

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.670
Together, we can do it!

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.010
<i>We'll become the
greatest Build Fighters!</i>

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:28.840
All right.

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:31.350
The ultimate secret of
the Kamiki Gunpla School!

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:39.310
<i>(Phoenix King Fist)
Houou Haoh-Ken!</i>

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.210
Gunpla Battle Club

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:07.670
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:22:07.670 --> 00:22:11.050
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:15.850
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:19.690
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.770
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:29.530
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:34.240
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:37.660
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:40.370
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:22:40.370 --> 00:22:42.630
<i>Qunﬁé; Jziriqyo Jkéoo/
With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:44.290
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:48.970
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:56.010
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:22:56.010 --> 00:23:01.060
...a <i>different truth? (let me see)</i>

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:07.980
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:23:07.980 --> 00:23:11.570
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:13.860
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:14.410
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:16.030
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:16.030 --> 00:23:16.910
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:19.910
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:22.290
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:23.250
<i>(Alive!)</i>

