Sekai, Yuu.

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:45.020
I don't need to say it, do I?

00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:47.730
Of course. We are...

00:23:48.150 --> 00:23:49.320
...challengers!

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.990
Let's go! Team Try Fighters!

